00014A20                            ; Subroutine called at the peak of a jump that transforms Sonic into Super Sonic
00014A20                            ; if he has enough rings and emeralds
00014A20                            ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
00014A20                            
00014A20                            ; ||||||||||||||| S U B R O U T I N E |||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||
